0,Laal language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laal_language,"Laal is an endangered language isolate spoken by 750 people in two villages in the Moyen-Chari prefecture of Chad on opposite banks of the Chari River, called Gori, and Damtar. It represents an isolated survival of an earlier language group of Central Africa.",Laal,Language isolate
